  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Source: Astarion's Book of Hungers</em></p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Dexterity, Intelligence, Charisma</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> Tireless Reveler</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Deception and Persuasion</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> Choose one kind of Gaming Set</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> Choose A or B: (A) Dagger, Gaming Set (same as above), Fine Clothes, Glass Bottle, Mirror, Perfume, Pouch, Tinderbox, 19 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p><p>You grew to adulthood in the beating heart of a large city, such as Baldur's Gate. You spent countless evenings in taverns, playhouses, parlors, and gambling dens, savoring all the city had to offer. You're a natural at interacting with people to learn their secrets, whether over a high-stakes game or at a high-class soiree. You might have been thrown out of an establishment or ten, but only by people who don't know how to party.</p>",
